# Keep secrets, host-built dependencies and local artefacts out of the build
# context: `COPY . .` otherwise baked .env into a layer and overwrote the
# Linux node_modules with macOS binaries on a local build.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
**/.output
**/dist
workers/covers
apps/guide
.claude
*.log
